<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>PopLoon Privacy Policy</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0b1220;
      --card: #121a2b;
      --text: #e8eefc;
      --muted: #a9b4cc;
      --accent: #ffd54f;
      --line: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0b1220 0%, #152238 100%);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .wrap {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 20px 64px;
    }
    .card {
      background: rgba(18, 26, 43, 0.92);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 28px 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 1.9rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }
    h2 {
      margin-top: 28px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--accent);
    }
    h3 {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }
    p, li { color: var(--muted); }
    strong, b { color: var(--text); }
    .meta {
      margin: 12px 0 20px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(255,213,79,0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,213,79,0.25);
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 12px 0 8px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    th, td {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 10px 12px;
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    th {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      color: var(--text);
    }
    td { color: var(--muted); }
    a { color: var(--accent); }
    code {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      padding: 1px 6px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.9em;
    }
    hr {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card">
      <h1>Privacy Policy — PopLoon</h1>
      <div class="meta">
        <div><strong>Effective date:</strong> November 19, 2026</div>
        <div><strong>Last updated:</strong> November 19, 2026</div>
        <div><strong>Operator:</strong> Only for Solution (“we,” “us,” “our”)</div>
        <div><strong>Contact:</strong> <a href="mailto:onlyforsolution@gmail.com">onlyforsolution@gmail.com</a></div>
        <div><strong>App:</strong> PopLoon (<code>com.poploon.app</code>)</div>
      </div>

      <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        PopLoon (“the App”) is a casual balloon-popping mobile game operated by Only for Solution.
        This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and protect information when you use the App on Android or iOS,
        and when you use related services such as our Balloon App API at <code>balloonappapi.emotionhealer.com</code>.
      </p>
      <p>By using the App, you agree to this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, do not use the App.</p>
      <p>PopLoon is an entertainment game. It is not a medical, clinical, or diagnostic product.</p>

      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>

      <h3>2.1 Information You Provide</h3>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Data</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Account credentials — email, password, full name (optional)</td><td>Create and secure your account (signup, OTP verification, login)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Profile information — full name, phone, bio, avatar URL</td><td>Display and update your profile</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Password reset email and OTP</td><td>Recover account access</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Support messages</td><td>Respond to support requests</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h3>2.2 Game Progress Information</h3>
      <p>When you play, we may store and sync game progress with our servers, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Level</li>
        <li>Score and high score</li>
        <li>Coins</li>
        <li>Lives</li>
        <li>Balloons popped</li>
        <li>Combo / best combo</li>
        <li>Game status (playing, paused, game over)</li>
        <li>Games played counters</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This lets you continue progress after logout/login and across sessions.</p>

      <h3>2.3 Photos / Balloon Images (Optional)</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>The image is selected from your device gallery with your permission</li>
        <li>The App may process the image on-device (for example, a simple cartoon/avatar-style filter) before showing it on balloons</li>
        <li>We do <strong>not</strong> require uploading that gallery photo to our servers for core gameplay</li>
        <li>If you enter an avatar URL in your profile, that URL may be saved with your account profile</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>2.4 Information Collected Automatically</h3>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Data</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Authentication token</td><td>Keep you signed in</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Device and app technical data</td><td>Troubleshooting, security, and reliability</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Technical logs — IP address, timestamps, errors</td><td>Fraud prevention and service reliability</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Advertising identifiers / ad interaction data (via Google Mobile Ads)</td><td>Show interstitial ads (for example after completing a level)</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h3>2.5 Information Stored on Your Device</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Login session / access token</li>
        <li>Basic cached account preferences needed for sign-in state</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>2.6 Information We Do Not Collect (for PopLoon)</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Precise GPS location</li>
        <li>Contacts list</li>
        <li>Microphone audio</li>
        <li>Health / fitness data</li>
        <li>Payment card details inside the App (any store billing is handled by Google Play / Apple)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Create and manage your PopLoon account</li>
        <li>Authenticate you and keep your session secure</li>
        <li>Save and restore game progress (level, score, coins, lives, etc.)</li>
        <li>Update and display your profile</li>
        <li>Show ads in the App (including interstitial ads between levels)</li>
        <li>Improve stability, security, and performance</li>
        <li>Respond to support requests</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal information.</p>

      <h2>4. Legal Bases (EEA / UK Users)</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Contract:</strong> To provide the App, account, and game features you request</li>
        <li><strong>Consent:</strong> Optional features such as gallery image access and personalized ads (where required)</li>
        <li><strong>Legitimate interests:</strong> Security, fraud prevention, and service improvement</li>
        <li><strong>Legal obligation:</strong> Compliance with applicable laws</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. How We Share Information</h2>
      <h3>5.1 Service Providers</h3>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Provider</th><th>Role</th><th>Typical Data</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Balloon App API (<code>balloonappapi.emotionhealer.com</code>) / emotionhealer.com infrastructure</td>
            <td>Backend hosting and API services</td>
            <td>Account, profile, game progress</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Google Mobile Ads (AdMob)</td>
            <td>In-app advertising</td>
            <td>Device/ad identifiers, coarse device info, ad events</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Google Play / Apple App Store</td>
            <td>App distribution and store services</td>
            <td>Account and purchase-related data handled by the stores</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h3>5.2 Legal and Safety</h3>
      <p>We may disclose information if required by law or necessary to protect rights, safety, or security.</p>

      <h3>5.3 Business Transfers</h3>
      <p>If our business is merged, acquired, or sold, your information may transfer to the successor organization under continued privacy protections.</p>

      <h2>6. Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        PopLoon may show interstitial ads (for example after a level is completed) using Google Mobile Ads.
        Ad networks may collect or receive device identifiers and usage data to provide and measure ads,
        subject to their own privacy policies and your device ad settings.
      </p>
      <p>You can often limit ad personalization in your device settings (Google / Apple advertising settings).</p>

      <h2>7. International Data Transfers</h2>
      <p>
        Your data may be processed outside your country, including India or other regions where our services or providers are hosted.
        Where required, we use appropriate safeguards for international transfers.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Data Retention</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Account and profile data</strong> — while your account is active, and for a limited period after deletion (typically up to 90 days for backup/cleanup)</li>
        <li><strong>Game progress</strong> — while your account is active; removed or anonymized when the account is deleted</li>
        <li><strong>Server logs</strong> — typically up to 90 days</li>
        <li><strong>Local session tokens</strong> — until logout, token expiry, or app data clear</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Some residual data may remain briefly in encrypted backups.</p>

      <h2>9. Your Rights and Choices</h2>
      <p>Depending on your location, you may have rights to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access your personal data</li>
        <li>Correct inaccurate information (including via in-app profile update)</li>
        <li>Delete your account (in-app <strong>Delete account</strong> uses <code>DELETE /api/v1/users/me</code>)</li>
        <li>Export / request a copy of your data</li>
        <li>Restrict or object to certain processing</li>
        <li>Manage ad preferences on your device</li>
      </ul>
      <p>California residents may have additional rights under CCPA/CPRA.</p>
      <p>To exercise rights, use in-app account tools where available or email <a href="mailto:onlyforsolution@gmail.com">onlyforsolution@gmail.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>10. Security</h2>
      <p>We use measures such as HTTPS, authenticated APIs (Bearer tokens), and access controls. No method of transmission or storage is 100% secure.</p>

      <h2>11. Children’s Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        The App is not directed to children under 13 (or under 16 where required by local law).
        If we learn that a child has provided personal data without appropriate consent, we will delete it.
      </p>

      <h2>12. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>Third-party services (including Google Mobile Ads and app stores) are governed by their own privacy policies. We are not responsible for their independent practices.</p>

      <h2>13. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. The updated version will be posted at the public policy URL, with a revised “Last updated” date.</p>

      <h2>14. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Only for Solution</strong><br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:onlyforsolution@gmail.com">onlyforsolution@gmail.com</a><br />
        Support: <a href="mailto:onlyforsolution@gmail.com">onlyforsolution@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
